The save reader in optimizer/src/save is a Rust port of civ6-savegame-parser
(https://github.com/bestander/civ6-savegame-parser, MIT License), including the
header walker that project vendored from pydt/civ6-save-parser
(https://github.com/pydt/civ6-save-parser, MIT License). civ6-types.json and
hash-tables.json in this directory are copied from civ6-savegame-parser.

